       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CONCHK.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT IN-FILE ASSIGN TO INDD
                  ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  IN-FILE.
       01  IN-REC  PIC X(5).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-STATUS  PIC 99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           OPEN INPUT IN-FILE.
           MOVE WS-STATUS TO RETURN-CODE.
           GOBACK.
